OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein will co-operate with
OL,4,APSNI over Drumcree protest, says
OL,5,AMcDonald
OL,6,
OL,7,FSinn Fein will co-operate with the
OL,8,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,9,F(PSNI) over any potential investigation
OL,10,Finto the protest on the Garvaghy Road,
OL,11,Fthe party president has said.
OL,13,FProtesters have remained on the
OL,14,FGarvaghy Road since Sunday 27 September
OL,15,Fas the fallout over the proposed
OL,16,FPortadown District Orange Lodge march
OL,17,Fcontinues, and rallies on both sides of
OL,18,Fthe dispute were held on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
